},{"t":"On map","h":"javascript:;"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Reset","h":"javascript:;"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Filters","h":"javascript:;"}]},{"t":"grid"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Copyright 2026 by the Greater Vancouver REALTORS®,"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Fraser Valley Real Estate Board and Chilliwack & District Real Estate Board. All Rights Reserved."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Written by"},{"t":"Jared Gibbons, REALTOR®","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/jared.html"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"I help buyers and sellers review zoning, strata records, title charges, and neighbourhood comps across Ladner and Delta Agricultural Land. I have been a licensed REALTOR® since 2015 with Royal LePage Little Oak Realty, with more than $500M in sales and 10 straight years in the FVREB Medallion Club (Top 1% of Fraser Valley Realtors). I ranked #8 of 5,061 Fraser Valley Realtors, Top 35 Under 35 at Royal LePage Canada, and Top 10 at Royal LePage BC. I grew up on a farm in Langley and live in Langley now. Call or text"},{"t":"604-928-1361","h":"tel:+16049281361"},{"t":"or"},{"t":"send me a message","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/contact.html"},{"t":"."}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Buying Farms, Westham Island Land & ALR Acreages in Ladner, BC"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Ladner Rural","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-rural-guide.html"},{"t":"and"},{"t":"East Delta","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/east-delta-guide.html"},{"t":"contain some of the highest-capability Class 1 to Class 3 alluvial agricultural soils in Canada. Fed by the Fraser River estuary and irrigated through the Delta Farmers' Institute / municipal ditch network, Ladner's Agricultural Land Reserve (ALR) supports commercial potato, vegetable, berry, cranberry, greenhouse, dairy, and equestrian operations across Westham Island, Crescent Island, Arthur Drive, and Ladner Trunk Road."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"ALC Residential Footprint Rules"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"On Delta ALR land (A1 Agricultural zone), Agricultural Land Commission regulations cap the principal farmhouse at 500 m² (5,382 sq ft) of total floor area and allow one secondary residence up to 90 m² (969 sq ft), subject to City of Delta Flood Construction Levels."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Irrigation, Drainage & Salinity"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Farm buyers in South Delta evaluate perimeter drainage ditches, field tile drainage, laser-levelling history, summer freshwater irrigation intake access, and winter waterfowl grazing management."}]},{"t":"h","level":3,"text":"Class 9 Farm Status & Leases"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Maintaining BC Assessment Class 9 Farm Status significantly reduces annual property taxes and affects Property Transfer Tax and GST treatment when active crop or livestock production continues directly or through a local farm lease."}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Ladner Farms & ALR Acreages — Frequently Asked Questions"},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"What makes Ladner and Westham Island farmland unique in Metro Vancouver?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Farm parcels in"},{"t":"Ladner Rural","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-rural-guide.html"},{"t":", Westham Island, and"},{"t":"East Delta","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/east-delta-guide.html"},{"t":"combine deep Fraser River delta silt-loam soils, mild coastal frost-free growing seasons, and established agricultural irrigation/drainage infrastructure minutes from Highway 99 and Highway 17."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"What is the maximum house size allowed on ALR land in Ladner?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Under BC Agricultural Land Commission (ALC) rules and City of Delta A1 zoning, the principal residence on an ALR parcel is limited to 500 m² (5,382 sq ft) of total floor area, plus a permitted small secondary residence up to 90 m² (969 sq ft) where servicing and flood-elevation rules are met."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"How do Flood Construction Levels (FCL) apply to farmhouses in Ladner Rural?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Rural Delta sits inside the diked Fraser River and Boundary Bay floodplain. New farmhouses must be engineered to the City of Delta's site-specific Flood Construction Level (FCL), using certified structural fill pads or raised foundations."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"How does a Ladner acreage qualify for BC Assessment Farm Class (Class 9)?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"BC Assessment grants Class 9 Farm Status when a parcel generates qualifying annual gross agricultural income ($2,500 on 0.8–4 hectares, $2,500 plus 5% of land value on parcels under 0.8 hectares, or $10,000 on parcels over 4 hectares) through owner farming or a multi-year crop/livestock lease."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"What utilities serve Ladner Rural and East Delta farms?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Most Ladner Rural and East Delta roads have municipal water mains at the road frontage (though agricultural field irrigation draws from the municipal ditch/slough system), while domestic wastewater relies on private engineered septic systems."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Does 5% GST apply when buying a farm in Ladner?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"GST applicability depends on whether the sale is structured as a commercial farm operation, leased farmland, or personal-use rural residence (where the farmhouse plus 0.5 hectares may be treated differently from the excess acreage). Always obtain written CPA advice before removing conditions."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"How do Ladner farms compare with Tsawwassen and Cloverdale farms?"}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Ladner and"},{"t":"Tsawwassen farms","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/tsawwassen-farms.html"},{"t":"sit on coastal South Delta deltaic soils West of Highway 99, whereas"},{"t":"Cloverdale farms","h":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/cloverdale-farms.html"},{"t":"sit further inland along the Serpentine and Nicomekl valleys in Surrey."}]},{"t":"p","parts":[{"t":"Explore More"}]},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Explore Ladner, Tsawwassen & Delta Real Estate"},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-homes-for-sale.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Homes for Sale"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-condos-under-800k.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Condos Under $800K"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-townhomes-under-1-2m.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Townhomes Under $1.2M"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-homes-under-1-8m.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Homes Under $1.8M"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-homes-over-1-8m.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Homes Over $1.8M"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-duplexes-for-sale.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Duplexes for Sale"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-lots-land.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Lots & Land"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/ladner-farms.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Ladner Farms & Acreages"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/tsawwassen-homes-for-sale.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Tsawwassen Homes for Sale"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/tsawwassen-condos-under-800k.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Tsawwassen Condos Under $800K"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/tsawwassen-townhomes-under-1-2m.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Tsawwassen Townhomes Under $1.2M"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://jaredgibbons.ca/tsawwassen-homes-under-1-8m.html","lines":[{"text":"MLS® Search"},{"text":"Tsawwassen Homes Under $1.8M"},{"text":"View page →"}]},{"t":"card","href":"https://